    "translation": "这次刺得更深些。"
  },
  {
    "asset": "sharedassets1.assets",
    "path_id": 171,
    "class": "DialogData",
    "source": "Be careful of its weight.",
    "translation": "小心它的重量。"
  },
  {
    "asset": "sharedassets1.assets",
    "path_id": 171,
    "class": "DialogData",
    "source": "Such length may be troublesome.",
    "translation": "这么长可能不太好使。"
  },
  {
    "asset": "sharedassets1.assets",
    "path_id": 171,
    "class": "DialogData",
    "source": "It is the Deepest Sword!",
    "translation": "这就是最深之剑！"
  },
  {
