    "path_id": 172,
    "class": "DialogData",
    "source": "Long the Dragon<br>lies ahead...",
    "translation": "前方沉睡着<br>恶龙……"
  },
  {
    "asset": "sharedassets1.assets",
    "path_id": 172,
    "class": "DialogData",
    "source": "The cavern looks deeper<br>than before.",
    "translation": "洞窟似乎比以前<br>更深了。"
  },
  {
    "asset": "sharedassets1.assets",
    "path_id": 172,
    "class": "DialogData",
    "source": "It's getting deeper and deeper.",
    "translation": "越来越深了。"
  },
  {
    "asset": "sharedassets1.assets",
    "path_id": 172,
    "class": "DialogData",
    "source": "It's even deeper now.<br>Don't give up.",
    "translation": "现在更深了。<br>别放弃。"
  },
  {
    "asset": "sharedassets1.assets",
    "path_id": 172,
    "class": "DialogData",
    "source": "So deep...",
    "translation": "好深……"
  },
